  "description": "The m1 vertical slice in grey box (docs/design/vertical-slice.md \u00a74, mw-e01.4): a 10 \u00d7 10 m spawn room behind a wooden door, a dim 20 m corridor with an ivy-faced ledge in its side alcove, a 12 \u00d7 12 m arena with two pillars, a floor brazier and a loot alcove 1.4 m up off its east side, and an iron exit door locked by the slice-exit lock. The alcove holds a chest rolling the slice-alcove-chest loot table, and the rusted gallery key that opens the exit lies at the Forgotten miner\u2019s post by pillar B (mw-e01.6) until the miner carries and drops it (mw-e01.5). Checkpoint volumes CP-1 (past the spawn door) and CP-2 (before the arena) request autosaves; walking into the vestibule behind the exit door sets slice.complete.",
